### ==========================================
### CarBravo Incentives API - Dashboard
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = mock-token


### ==========================================
### Dashboard Summary
### ==========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### Dashboard Activity
### ==========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### Dashboard Expiring Programs
### ==========================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/expiring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}